WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.033
The Marketplace lists published PAMM programs with verified track records, fees and risk limits.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:12.300
Compare managers before committing a single dollar.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.395
Found a program you like?

00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:18.165
Send a join request with your deposit amount.

00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:24.700
The manager approves it and your allocation starts tracking the program's NAV.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:34.787
Monitor everything on the Verified Performance page: returns, drawdown and your allocation, all reconciled against broker truth.

00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:38.018
Withdrawals follow the same audited path.

00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:39.200
Welcome aboard.
